sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Cross-account private DNS requires two account owners
accDescr: The hosted-zone owner authorizes the VPC, the VPC owner associates it, and the hosted-zone owner removes the authorization while the association remains.
participant A as Account A, zone owner
participant B as Account B, VPC owner
Note over A: CreateVPCAssociationAuthorization
A-->>B: Association authorized for this VPC
Note over B: AssociateVPCWithHostedZone
B-->>A: Association complete
Note over A: DeleteVPCAssociationAuthorization
Note over B: Existing association remains usable
